{
  "title": "Hirz-e-Imam Hasan al-Askari (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This evil-repelling prayer is ascribed to Imam al-Hasan ibn Ali al-Askari (a.s.):\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME \nIn the Name of Allah; the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nيَا عُدَّتِىْ عِنْدَ شِدَّتِىْ \nYAA U’DDATEE I’NDA SHIDDATEE \nO my means in my ordeals!\nوَ يَا غَوْثِىْ عِنْدَ كُرْبَتِىْ \nWA YAA GHAWSEE I’NDA KURBATEE\nO my aide in my agonies!\nوَ يَا مُوْنِسِىْ عِنْدَ وَحْدَتِىْۤ \nWA YAA MOONESEE I’NDA WAHDATEE\nO my entertainment in my loneliness!\nاُحْرُسْنِىْ بِعَيْنِكَ الَّتِىْ لَا تَنَامُ \nOHRUSNEE BE-A’YNEKAL LATEE LAA TANAAMO \nGuard me with Your eye that never sleeps\nوَاكْنُفْنِىْ بِرُكْنِكَ الَّذِىْ لَا يُرَامُ.\nWAKNUFNEE BERUKNEKAL LAZEE LAA YORAAMO.\nand embrace me with Your support that is invincible."
}
